# Never commit runtime state or secrets.
coordinator.db
coordinator.db-wal
coordinator.db-shm
*.db
tokens.json
*.tmp
# Manual/ad-hoc backups of the secret above (e.g. `tokens.json.bak-<stamp>`
# made by hand before running gen_token.py) land untracked-and-not-ignored
# without this -- confirmed 2026-08-21: one such stray file wedged
# phase3_queue_writer's clean-tree refusal on the hub for ~1.5 days
# ("Phase 3 does NOT autostash -- resolve the dirt by hand"). Same shape
# CLAUDE.md documents for coordinator/writer_health.json. The real fix is
# not making this kind of backup at all -- see the note in
# deploy/gen_token.py -- this is belt-and-braces so a future one is inert.
*.bak-*
tokens.json.bak*
